{"id":"vod_sn_39056","vodId":"39056","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"星际牛仔","name_cn":"星际牛仔","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1717b46b7273e34739e4bc19e27f2e76.jpg"},"summary":"2071年，随着超光速航行技术的实现，人类得以在太阳系范围内方便的移动，但是由于设计上的失误，这种技术引发了月球的爆炸，无数的月球碎片被吸引向地球，造成了空前绝后的大灾难。存活下来的人类逃离地球，并开始在太阳系各地建立家园。由于这次灾难，国家政府等权利机构都极为不稳定、治安问题也成为了一个难题。有些组织开始允许个人抓捕通缉的罪犯并换取奖金，这就是“赏金猎人”。史派克和杰特是驾驶飞船BEBOP号在宇宙中以捉拿逃犯获取奖金为生的赏金猎人。两人在星际间的旅程中，结识了身负巨债、嗜财如命的美女菲和电脑神童艾德，并收养了拥有高智商的数据狗爱因。从此，四人一狗游荡在广阔之宇宙之中，在自己与他人的生活中经历著种种悲欢离合，也寻找著各自的过去。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VRCMtK7iVb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4M2fBPP12s1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zqqqbdrDmS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BrSHsrtC8C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7awqHL3Hp01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JcNHwKFFzr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YRafybpgph1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6VL1R6wKaY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/izRk0fitdk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ntdk2d1LFE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8iwJc5FaQ01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c8B0CwvfMi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yp0zS8DMuJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SEhZSN2QW11/vid